/- English proof (translation)
Replace the relevant objects with their definitions. Replace the chosen expression with an arbitrary variable. Establish an intermediate fact. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Proceed by induction.

Treat this case separately. Treat this case separately. A detailed English derivation is pending.
